dear friends  today we celebrate international women's  day  i want to start by saying thank you to  all the women and girls  who inspire us to shape a more equal  future  empower others so no one is left behind  and are leading the recovery from the  covet 19 pandemic  inspiration empowerment leadership  this is what defines women in europe and  beyond  europe needs your creativity and  entrepreneurial potential to lead the  fair  green and digital recovery of europe in  europe  41 of scientists and engineers are women  although we have reached 48 of female  phd graduates  women makes up only 33 percent of  researchers  and 22 percent of the head of higher  education institutions in europe  this needs to change it is clear that  without its talented and innovative  women  europe cannot and will not move forward  that is why today on international  women's day  i'm proud to announce women tech eu  a brand new initiative to support  women-led deep tech startups and give  them a boost  to grow their company into the deep tech  champions of tomorrow  at the same time i'm also proud to  celebrate  the closing of my year-long social media  campaign  eu women for future since the past  2020 international women's day i have  had the privilege  to showcase the remarkable achievements  of european women  in research innovation education  culture and sport and tough this  campaign is ending soon  we'll continue supporting and  recognizing talented women  who show us that nothing can stand in  the way  of girls committed to achieving their  dreams  allow me to guarantee you that i'm  determined to continue stepping up  the european efforts on women  empowerment  in particular i'm committed to ensuring  that the gender dimension  is fully integrated into the european  policy  for research innovation education  culture  and sport with horizon europe program  we reaffirm our commitment to gender  equality  in research and innovation for example  having a gender equality plan in place  will become an eligibility criterion  these measures are complementary to  those from  other programs within my portfolio such  as erasmus plus  with strong synergies with the european  universities alliances initiative  and the european institute of innovation  and technology  which will offer training in stem skills  to 40 000 girls  i would like to conclude calling upon  all of you  men and women of europe to join our new  women tech eu initiative sign up today  to become a mentor an inspiring  innovator  and business coach for talented european  women in tech  you girls and women have no limit  to what you can reach you know that you  can count on my full support  so that europe becomes your place  to develop your full potential let's  stay united  to continue to unlock the full potential  of women  for leading europe towards a green  digital healthy and resilient future  thank you

